---
import bg from "../assets/protesis_v.webp";
---

<div id="about" class="bg-gray-950 text-white">
  <div
    class="md:max-w-6xl mx-auto mt-10 pl-10 pr-10 md:pr-0 grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-5"
  >
    <!-- TEXTO -->
    <div class="col-span-2 py-15">
      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl mb-10">About me</h2>
      <p>
        For as long as I can remember, I've been passionate about technology
        aimed at improving people's quality of life. I've been motivated by the
        field of Biomedical Engineering and, especially, by software
        development. This motivation has led me to train in areas related to
        programming, information processing, and working on multidisciplinary
        projects, combining technical knowledge with a vision focused on
        innovation and problem-solving.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- IMAGEN DE FONDO -->
    <div
      class="hidden md:block h-full bg-cover bg-center"
      style={`background-image: url(${bg.src})`}
    >
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
